+    *   Compute child bit: `child_bit = 1 << index`.
+    *   Check existence: `exist = (node_->_mask & child_bit) != 0` [S1, unofficial].
+    *   Compute next node position: `next_node_position = node_position + (cell_vector * node_extent / 2)` [S1, unofficial].
 
